# Optional: override the Buttondown username used by the signup form.
# The username defaults to `zaboco` (hardcoded in src/components/Newsletter.astro),
# so you normally don't need this. Set it only to point the form at a different
# list. This value is PUBLIC (it appears in the rendered form) — not a secret.
# PUBLIC_BUTTONDOWN_USERNAME=zaboco

# Umami analytics. Set the website ID (from the Umami dashboard) to enable
# tracking; leave unset for local dev / forks to stay untracked. PUBLIC, not a
# secret — it ships in the page. See docs/analytics-setup.md.
# PUBLIC_UMAMI_WEBSITE_ID=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
# Optional: override the script host. Default is Umami Cloud US. Use the EU host
# or a self-hosted URL if applicable.
# PUBLIC_UMAMI_SRC=https://eu.umami.is/script.js
